1000 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The \275\057\275\275 method splits current into a capacitor\055like part that scales with scan rate \050\275\051 \050non\055faradaic current\051 and a battery\055like part \050faradaic current\051 that scales with its square  root \050\275\275\051\056 It\047s widely used to classify energy\055storage materials\073 but rarely tested against a known answer\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1001 0 R
     /Pg 992 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

