     /P 1042 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 992 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1002 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Standard way to deconvolute charge storage currents is asymptotic Da \222 \036\072 it fails at finite Da and perfect fit \050R2H 1\051 misleads\056 )
