1006 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We chose the simplest\054 best\055understood case\056 One clean redox reaction \053 planar electrode and checked the split two ways\072 in simulation \050where the exact answer is known\051 and in experiment \050ferrocene as active species\054 capacitive current measured directly from the electrolyte\051)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1007 0 R
     /Pg 992 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
